(7462139, 1183064, 19825, '<td valign="top">There are times that the 1200 pixel dimension does not do an image justice. Never has that been more evident to me than with this image. I suspect this would be interesting to look at spanning eight feet of wall. I expected a range of images in this challenge, but this is on a different spectrum entirely.</td>', 'There are times that the 1200 pixel dimension does not do an image justice. Never has that been more evident to me than with this image. I suspect this would be interesting to look at spanning eight feet of wall. I expected a range of images in this challenge, but this is on a different spectrum entirely.', '2016-06-29 12:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
