(7462148, 1183064, 140305, '<td valign="top">I wrote a comment a little earlier but had to come back and change it. After I shut my computer down and walked away I found this image was still in my head and it refuses to leave! I think that''s what great art does, it stays with you, haunts you, for a long time. Absolutely beautiful piece of work here, I hope it nets you the blue.</td>', 'I wrote a comment a little earlier but had to come back and change it. After I shut my computer down and walked away I found this image was still in my head and it refuses to leave! I think that''s what great art does, it stays with you, haunts you, for a long time. Absolutely beautiful piece of work here, I hope it nets you the blue.', '2016-06-29 13:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
