(7462793, 1183603, 100831, '<td valign="top">To me a collage is a compilation of images, combined to make a new, coherent image. Assuming the people and the car are added to the background scene, this image meets that challenge but if it were obvious to the viewer it would better suit the "collage" theme. Either way, I like the entry very much.... love the golds, the character placement and the dreamy background city. 7 from me. A picture paints a story.</td>', 'To me a collage is a compilation of images, combined to make a new, coherent image. Assuming the people and the car are added to the background scene, this image meets that challenge but if it were obvious to the viewer it would better suit the "collage" theme. Either way, I like the entry very much.... love the golds, the character placement and the dreamy background city. 7 from me. A picture paints a story.', '2016-07-04 12:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
