(7463193, 1183064, 86447, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> 497 separate images man!! I''m thinking sc are kicking themselves they didn''t place a limit on the images that were to be used. I really don''t know how you make time or  you get the time to create these images, anyway Kudo''s to you  and congratulations on the blue. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>They''re not 497 different images, right?   The software that I played with to make a mosaic for me (didn''t know it was legal to use software to put it all together, so did mine by hand... *heavy sigh*), <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a>, you just upload the base photo you want, then upload as many images you want to use for the "fill".    <br/> <br/>Go to the potty, come back, and it''s all done for you.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: 497 separate images man!! I''m thinking sc are kicking themselves they didn''t place a limit on the images that were to be used. I really don''t know how you make time or  you get the time to create these images, anyway Kudo''s to you  and congratulations on the blue.   They''re not 497 different images, right?   The software that I played with to make a mosaic for me (didn''t know it was legal to use software to put it all together, so did mine by hand... *heavy sigh*),  Neat, you just upload the base photo you want, then upload as many images you want to use for the "fill".     Go to the potty, come back, and it''s all done for you. ', '2016-07-06 12:49:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7463208, 1183064, 57447, '<td valign="top">Incredible!!!</td>', 'Incredible!!!', '2016-07-06 15:03:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7463234, 1183064, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> 497 separate images man!! I''m thinking sc are kicking themselves they didn''t place a limit on the images that were to be used. I really don''t know how you make time or  you get the time to create these images, anyway Kudo''s to you  and congratulations on the blue. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>They''re not 497 different images, right?   The software that I played with to make a mosaic for me (didn''t know it was legal to use software to put it all together, so did mine by hand... *heavy sigh*), <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a>, you just upload the base photo you want, then upload as many images you want to use for the "fill".    <br/> <br/>Go to the potty, come back, and it''s all done for you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I did use a programme to  put the basic image together.<br/>I did use a source image of my own.<br/>I did use 497 different images used multiple times in the cells.<br/>I did manually change tge placement of some of the images.<br/>I did do further editing.<br/>It was not entirly the programme that created this piece.</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: Originally posted by Neat: 497 separate images man!! I''m thinking sc are kicking themselves they didn''t place a limit on the images that were to be used. I really don''t know how you make time or  you get the time to create these images, anyway Kudo''s to you  and congratulations on the blue.   They''re not 497 different images, right?   The software that I played with to make a mosaic for me (didn''t know it was legal to use software to put it all together, so did mine by hand... *heavy sigh*),  Neat, you just upload the base photo you want, then upload as many images you want to use for the "fill".     Go to the potty, come back, and it''s all done for you.   I did use a programme to  put the basic image together.I did use a source image of my own.I did use 497 different images used multiple times in the cells.I did manually change tge placement of some of the images.I did do further editing.It was not entirly the programme that created this piece.', '2016-07-06 17:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7463240, 1183064, 86447, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> 497 separate images man!! I''m thinking sc are kicking themselves they didn''t place a limit on the images that were to be used. I really don''t know how you make time or  you get the time to create these images, anyway Kudo''s to you  and congratulations on the blue. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>They''re not 497 different images, right?   The software that I played with to make a mosaic for me (didn''t know it was legal to use software to put it all together, so did mine by hand... *heavy sigh*), <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a>, you just upload the base photo you want, then upload as many images you want to use for the "fill".    <br/> <br/>Go to the potty, come back, and it''s all done for you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I did use a programme to  put the basic image together.<br/>I did use a source image of my own.<br/>I did use 497 different images used multiple times in the cells.<br/>I did manually change tge placement of some of the images.<br/>I did do further editing.<br/>It was not entirly the programme that created this piece. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I wasn''t dissing your image... or your efforts, Judi!   <br/> <br/>I was trying to tell Anita how she could make her own... <br/> <br/>This is gorgeous, Judi!<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: Originally posted by Lydia: Originally posted by Neat: 497 separate images man!! I''m thinking sc are kicking themselves they didn''t place a limit on the images that were to be used. I really don''t know how you make time or  you get the time to create these images, anyway Kudo''s to you  and congratulations on the blue.   They''re not 497 different images, right?   The software that I played with to make a mosaic for me (didn''t know it was legal to use software to put it all together, so did mine by hand... *heavy sigh*),  Neat, you just upload the base photo you want, then upload as many images you want to use for the "fill".     Go to the potty, come back, and it''s all done for you.   I did use a programme to  put the basic image together.I did use a source image of my own.I did use 497 different images used multiple times in the cells.I did manually change tge placement of some of the images.I did do further editing.It was not entirly the programme that created this piece.   I wasn''t dissing your image... or your efforts, Judi!    I was trying to tell Anita how she could make her own...  This is gorgeous, Judi!', '2016-07-06 17:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7463246, 1183064, 27133, '<td valign="top">Thanks Lydia. :) no offence taken.  I know it is easy to let programmes do the work but I just wanted people to know there was a lot more involved in the process.  Each of the cell images were edited prior to loading them into the programme to give the polished look.</td>', 'Thanks Lydia. :) no offence taken.  I know it is easy to let programmes do the work but I just wanted people to know there was a lot more involved in the process.  Each of the cell images were edited prior to loading them into the programme to give the polished look.', '2016-07-06 18:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
